  "body": "Unlike for other types to which `step` applies, the [specification for `datetime-local`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#local-date-and-time-state-(type=datetime-local)) does not mention what to do if `step` is `\"any\"`. I noticed this while working on updating documentation for the input types' attribute support on MDN this week and figured it's worth bringing up.",
